<speak>That sounds more comfortable for everyone travelling with you. Were you able to do the quieter things you enjoy, like walking around a neighbourhood rather than rushing from one attraction to the next? You don't need to tell me the booking details; I'm just interested in how the trip felt. Some clients say that leaving a free morning makes a holiday feel less like another schedule to manage. Though of course, with family, everyone may have a different idea of a relaxing day.</speak>